{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL9MXLCreditV2idSSSgvp","role":"symbol","title":"id","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLCredit\/id"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The optional-unique-id attribute group allows an element to optionally specify an ID that is unique to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entire document. This attribute group is not used for a required id attribute, or for an id attribute that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specifies an id reference."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlcredit\/id"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLCredit"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps to the MusicXML "},{"code":"id","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLCredit/id":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlcredit\/id","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The optional-unique-id attribute group allows an element to optionally specify an ID that is unique to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entire document. This attribute group is not used for a required id attribute, or for an id attribute that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specifies an id reference.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLCredit\/id","title":"id"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLCredit":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLCredit","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLCredit","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The credit type represents the appearance of the title, composer, arranger, lyricist, copyright, dedication,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and other text, symbols, and graphics that commonly appear on the first page of a score. The credit-words,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credit-symbol, and credit-image elements are similar to the words, symbol, and image elements for directions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However, since the credit is not part of a measure, the default-x and default-y attributes adjust the origin","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"relative to the bottom left-hand corner of the page. The enclosure for credit-words and credit-symbol is none","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by default.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLCredit","title":"MXLCredit","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlcredit"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"}}}